Package: nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-bin (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-71xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-71xx-kernel-${kernel:Flavour} | nvidia-legacy-71xx-kernel-dkms,
Recommends:
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-71xx-glx,
 xorg-server-legacy-nvidia-2,
Provides: nvidia-legacy-driver
Conflicts: nvidia-driver, nvidia-legacy-driver
Replaces: nvidia-legacy-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 71.86.15 driver metapackage (TNT/TNT2, GeForce 256, GeForce 2/4 MX (NV0x, NV1x))
 The 71.86.15 driver from the NVIDIA 71xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for noble.
 .
 Supported hardware: TNT/TNT2, GeForce 256, GeForce 2/4 MX (NV0x, NV1x).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2011. Forward-port target kernel 6.12 LTS / xserver ABI 2. Very high risk.
 .
 SECURITY WARNING: this driver series receives NO security updates from NVIDIA
 and has publicly known, unpatched vulnerabilities. Install it only on isolated
 or offline systems, or where the hardware leaves no supported alternative.
 debconf shows this warning again at install time.
 .
 This package is BEST-EFFORT for ubuntu2404: the shipped X server ABI
 (25) is newer than what this driver officially supports
 (2). IgnoreABI is enabled automatically. Test before relying on it.

Package: nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 71.86.15 driver — core runtime libraries
 Shared libraries used by the NVIDIA 71.86.15 driver: libnvidia-glcore,
 libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore and friends. Install the :i386 variant
 alongside for 32-bit OpenGL applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 71.86.15 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings' backend, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump and
 the nvidia-persistenced daemon for the 71.86.15 driver.

Package: libgl1-nvidia-legacy-71xx-glx
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version})
Provides: libgl1-nvidia-glx
Description: NVIDIA legacy 71.86.15 driver — libGL / GLX
 The NVIDIA implementation of libGL and the GLX extension for the 71.86.15
 driver, wired through glvnd where the distro provides it.


